  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued Support for Operations of Sahara Forest Project in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to realize a 20 hectare commercial production facility in Aqaba for production of a range of vegetables, using solar power energy and desalinated water. The project will ensure continued operations of the current facility, as well as prepare for its expansion. In addition, the project will conduct R&amp;D and awareness raising on the importance of actions towards combating climate change, desertification, and deforestation. There is a spesific comprehensive training program for young female engineers within the Water-Energy-Food Nexus.</narrative>
  </description>
